      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Match winner",
          "heading": "Ikanivere's second-half double turns 13-7 deficit into Fiji's 21-16 win over Italy",
          "body": "Saturday's 21-16 win in Udine turned after the interval, when Ikanivere struck twice, according to Rugbyrama, which judged Italy deserving of their 13-7 half-time lead after dominating the first period. Reuters framed it as Fiji's first Nations Championship victory, and FBC News saw a Flying Fijians side showing progress in a hard-fought win. Rugbyrama noted that the result still leaves Jake White's men bottom of their pool, the same place Italy finish, with the closing weekend at Twickenham to come."
        },
