    "391": {
      "date": "2026-11-23",
      "edition": "Monday 23 November",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Selection row",
          "heading": "Liam Botham says Tandy got it wrong dropping James for 26-29 loss",
          "body": "James Botham was left out of the 23 for Saturday's 26-29 defeat by Australia, a week after his 30-tackle, player-of-the-match display against New Zealand, with Cardiff colleague Alex Mann preferred. His father, a self-declared \"massive supporter\" of Tandy, asked on LinkedIn: \"How do you leave him out after a performance like that?\" Tandy had said Botham's impending fatherhood played no part, citing workloads after nearly 350 tackles: \"We have depth and genuine competition, so it was always the plan to freshen things up.\""
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
