      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Scotland threat",
          "heading": "Pumas' Twickenham finale against Scotland: BBC's Tom English wants McConnell let loose",
          "body": "Argentina's last assignment of the Nations Championship is a fourth-v-fourth meeting with Gregor Townsend's side, the warm-up act before the France-South Africa final. Writing for BBC Sport, Tom English singled out Liam McConnell after he and Darcy Graham each scored hat-tricks in Saturday's 11-try rout of an understrength Japan. He also flagged Scotland's seven first-half penalties in that game. Scotland lost at home to the Pumas in November before winning in Argentina in July."
        },
