          "kicker": "Discipline warning",
          "heading": "Les Kiss flags 14 conceded penalties in 29-26 win before Ireland reunion",
          "body": "Kiss has warned that discipline must improve before his Wallabies meet Ireland, the side whose defence he organised between 2009 and 2015. \"The discipline was a little bit disappointing, I must say, it kept Wales in the game with field position,\" he said of Saturday's Cardiff Test. Taniela Tupou summed up the night: a try, a turnover and scrum dominance, but four first-half penalties. Ireland arrive fresh from a 20-17 win over South Africa, and Australia have lost their last six Tests against them."
        },
