          "kicker": "Selection gamble",
          "heading": "Eddie Jones' nine-change Japan side swept aside 67-5 at Murrayfield",
          "body": "Saturday's Murrayfield Test finished 67-5 to Scotland, Jones having made nine changes after the 78-15 loss to England. The entire front row was new — Sojiro Otsuka, Kenji Sato and Ryosuke Iwaihara — as were fly-half Shinya Komura and the centre pairing of Charlie Lawrence and Jisu Lee. The rebuilt side trailed 29-0 at the break, and only Takuro Matsunaga's 52nd-minute try kept Japan off nil."
        },
